  "frame": "each root (Fax, FaxPaper, Cassette, CassetteBox, DropBox, ObjectPC, Laptop, TapeDeck, MeteoScreen) in its own frame: z up, the front -y; origin on the surface it stands on (z = 0) under its middle - the drop box: the post on the ground; the cassette: its middle; the tape recorder: the middle of its back face. Every pivot / pos here is in its root's frame. In devices.blend the roots stand apart (display_offset); their FBX is exported with the root at the origin",
