  "colliders": "BoxCollider per entry on its parent: center / size in the parent's own frame (its pivot, no rotation), centerUnity / sizeUnity the same in Unity axes; center_root: in the root's frame. The COL_ objects are in the .blend for reference (collection Colliders), not in the FBX",
  "kit_instances": "snow_kit models placed as instances (the computer's monitor): in devices.blend an empty showing the collection linked from ../snow_kit/snow_kit.blend (props kit_item); in Unity put the kit's prefab (Assets/Kit/Prefabs/<item>) under the parent with pos / rot (prefab frame) or posUnity / rotUnity_xyzw",
  "placements": "where forest_far's prefabs take a model: under the parent (a forest_far root) at pos / yaw (the parent's frame) or posUnity / rotUnity_xyzw - the tape recorder in each dish cabinet, the weather screen on the weather station (forest_far 1.1)",
